msgid "内核开发约定"
msgstr "Kernel Development Conventions"

msgid "模块与注释"
msgstr "Modules and Comments"

msgid ""
"先阅读 AGENT.md、相关模块与构建图。每个生产文件独立编译，由本地 Kbuild 登记，不包含 .c/.inc 实现代替拆分，不恢复全局源列表。 "
"模块内共享状态只定义一次，跨文件可见不意味着对用户公开；锁、IRQ 状态、 所有权和生命周期必须在接口中表达。"
msgstr ""
"Read AGENT.md, the relevant modules, and the build graph first. Each production file is compiled "
"independently and registered in its local Kbuild. Do not include .c/.inc implementations in place "
"of splitting files or restore global source lists. Define shared module state only once. Cross-"
"file visibility does not mean public userspace exposure; interfaces must express locks, IRQ state,"
" ownership, and lifecycle."

msgid "保留现有 Doxygen 函数注释约定，说明职责、参数、可空性、所有权、容量与 返回错误；不要为文档重组批量改写算法或函数签名。"
msgstr ""
"Retain existing Doxygen function-comment conventions, documenting responsibilities, parameters, "
"nullability, ownership, capacity, and returned errors. Do not broadly rewrite algorithms or "
"function signatures to reorganize documentation."

msgid "范围与提交"
msgstr "Scope and Commits"

msgid ""
"不修改导入的 Linux Kbuild/Kconfig 引擎来规避测试。源迁移映射位于 configs/kernel-source-map.json，仅供审计，不参与生产编译。 新 UAPI "
"需要导出白名单和用户态联动；普通重构保持磁盘格式和行为。 只有用户明确授权才提交/推送，先推本仓，再由父仓更新 gitlink。"
msgstr ""
"Do not modify imported Linux Kbuild/Kconfig engines to evade tests. configs/kernel-source-map.json"
" is a source migration map for auditing only, not production compilation. New UAPI requires export"
" allowlisting and userspace coordination; ordinary refactoring preserves disk formats and "
"behavior. Commit/push only with explicit user authorization: push this repository first, then "
"update the gitlink in the parent repository."
